WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.502
-It's Christmas,
a time when friends and family

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:05.839
come together
to celebrate the season.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.375
It's been a great night,
but it's getting late

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.676
and your guests
just aren't leaving.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:14.113
-And that's when you realize
mistletoe isn't edible.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:17.283
-Oh!
-Oh, that's a good one, Jimbo!

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.985
-You've given them
all the hints,

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.887
like commenting on the time...

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.356
-Can you guys believe
it's 11:00 p.m. already?

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:26.459
-I got nowhere to be.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.161
-...over-the-top yawning...

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.163
-Ughhhhh.

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:32.699
-I don't know.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.867
-Ugh!

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.835
Ughh!!

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.804
-You've even tried standing up

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:40.239
and announcing, "Well, I guess
I should be going,

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.741
since it's so late.
Wait, I live here.

00:00:42.741 --> 00:00:44.377
I'm not the one
who should be leaving."

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.278
-Well, I guess
I should be goin',

00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:47.981
since it's so late.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.083
Wait. I live here!

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.551
I'm not the one
who should be leaving.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:55.120
-Oh, boy, someone had
a little too much alcohol.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.623
Sit down, there, Cap'n.
Sit down.

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.525
-When all of those
still don't work,

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:00.860
it's time for the newest scent

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.929
from Yankee Candle's
Holiday Collection.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.131
Introducing the "Get the [Bleep]
out of my house" candle.

00:01:06.131 --> 00:01:07.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.035
It's the uninviting, new
fragrance

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.469
that will let your guests know

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.505
it's time to get the [Bleep]
out of your house.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.408
Simply light the candle,
and within minutes,

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.877
unwanted guests will be
a thing of the past.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.013
-Oh, my God.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.382
[ Sniffing ]

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:24.884
What's that smell?

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.986
-You mean the Christmas spirit?

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:30.623
-No, smells like hot garbage,

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:32.992
like someone
microwaving garbage.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.693
Oh!
-I'm sorry.

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:36.629
I just remembered
I have a thing.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:39.399
It's, um -- It's
my dog's ballet recital.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.833
-Oh, fun.
We should do this again.

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.202
-Okay. [ Clears throat ]

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:44.169
-Now available
in a variety of fragrances,

00:01:44.169 --> 00:01:46.238
including Old Shrimp,

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:47.640
Sweaty Crocs,

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.009
Hot Broccoli in a Ziplock Bag,

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.377
Egg Fart,

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.245
and New Jersey.

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:54.447
Any one of these are sure

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.149
to leave your guests
with a headache,

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.217
wondering, "Did I
put on deodorant?"

00:01:58.217 --> 00:01:59.785
-Hey, I think
I'm gonna get going.

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:02.288
-No, you just got here
seven hours ago.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.822
Stay.
-I'm just gonna

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:06.292
go run to the hospital.
-Whatever you think is best.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.361
Yeah, okay.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.329
Scatter. Scatter.

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:12.932
-This Christmas,
let your guests know

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.001
it's time to [Bleep] leave.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:19.105
-[ Grunting ]

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.541
[ Cheers and applause ]

